5	   - compact_boundary records have parentUuid null, so the chain walk naturally
6	     stops at the live context's edge after a compaction
7	   - isSidechain records are subagent turns; never part of the main context
8	   - attachment kinds have different semantics: deferred_tools_delta accumulates,
9	     skill_listing / output_style / agent_listing supersede, mcp_instructions accumulates */
10	'use strict';
11	
